(n) "State Biodiversity Board" means the State Biodiversity Board established under section 22; 

(o) "sustainable use" means the use of components of biological diversity in such manner and at such rate that does not lead to the decline of the biological diversity thereby maintaining its potential to meet the needs and aspirations pf present and future generations; 

(p) "value added products" means products which may contain portions or extracts of plants and animals in unrecognizable and physical inseparable form.

